          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "amo’anopapalralrao Vedhao moa dhakerale okame lroho, la imia’e ’a pokoa’o?",
          "chineseText": "我明天要和Vedhao去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
